  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0:\n\t\t\t- Added collapsible unchanged regions with ellipsis rows; click-to-expand.\n\t\t\t- Gutter click collapses contiguous unchanged sections.\n\t\t\t- Right-click context menu in text areas: Expand all collapsed / Collapse all expanded (context-aware).\n\t\t\t- Search: case-sensitive toggle, improved scroll-into-view behavior.\n\t\t\t- Unified font family/size across gutter and content via CSS variables.\n\t\t\t- Fixed minor issues with line number alignment and scroll sync.",
